    description: "_extract_config_embedding encodes ANSWER_PATTERNS (41), BIG_PICTURE_QUESTIONS (127) and NEGATIVE_PATTERNS (12) live on every call (fake-model repro: encode batches [41,127,4,12,41,127,4,12] over two calls). _embedding_data ships ANSWER/BIGPIC/NEGATIVE_PROBES_B64; the ANSWER/BIGPIC getters (sketch_embeddings ~751/768) have no caller and NEGATIVE has no reader; sketch.py and sketch_embeddings.py keep duplicate pattern lists. Either use the precomputed arrays (guarded by a model/list hash) or stop generating them.\n\nFound by the 2026-10-10 docstring-staleness audit (reviewer + default-REJECT verifier, reproduced). Notebook: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10102026.md."  # fa47
